:: StoryTitle
Terminal Template

:: StoryData
{
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.9",
  "start": "Login",
  "zoom": 1
}

:: Setup [startup] {"position":"25,25","size":"100,100"}
<!-- Starting values. Change these to fit your game. -->
(set: $flagged to 0)

:: Login {"position":"150,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="sys">WORKFORCE MONITOR v2.3 &middot; CONNECTED</div>
Welcome back, moderator #4471.
You have 3 posts to review. Average review time must stay under 9 seconds.

[[> review queue->Queue]]
[[> logout->Logout]]

:: Queue {"position":"275,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="sys">POST 1 of 3 &middot; flagged by algorithm &middot; confidence 61%</div>
"Protest downtown at 6pm. Bring water."

(link: "> remove")[(set: $flagged to it + 1)(goto: "Result")]
(link: "> approve")[(goto: "Result")]

:: Result {"position":"400,25","size":"100,100"}
<div class="sys">DECISION LOGGED</div>
Posts removed today: $flagged
(if: $flagged is 0)[<div class="warn">WARNING: your removal rate is below team average.</div>]

[[> next post->Queue]]

:: Logout {"position":"275,150","size":"100,100"}
<div class="sys">SESSION ENDED</div>
Unfinished reviews have been reassigned. This has been noted.

:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
/* ===== Terminal template: the whole look lives here ===== */
tw-sidebar { display: none; }                 /* hide the undo arrow */
tw-story { background: #050805; color: #33ff66; font-family: "Courier New", Consolas, monospace; }
tw-passage { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(51,255,102,.45); }
.sys { color: #0b0; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0b0; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; }
.warn { color: #ffcc33; text-shadow: none; margin-top: 10px; }
tw-link, tw-link.visited, tw-link:hover { color: #9dffb5; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
tw-link:hover { background: #33ff66; color: #050805; }   /* highlight a command when you point at it */
